+# Launcher keyboard state checks
+
+Run `dotnet run --project tests/LauncherKeyboardTest` with .NET 8.
+
+This links the production state owner used by the explicit iOS launcher keyboard.
+It checks bounded edits, one active field, repeated taps, switching between fields
+in either draw order, Done/Cancel, modal/server changes, forgotten saved credentials
+and repeated login lifecycles. It does not present an iOS keyboard or validate UIKit
+window-scene behavior; that requires the connected phone.
